<div><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Key benefits</span></h2></div></div></div></div><div class="container three-column-tile"><div class="row"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Protect your system" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Protect your system</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Provide overcurrent and earth fault protection for MV substations, backing up main devices. Detect earth faults in isolated or compensated systems with high-speed elements for rapid tripping to restore power.</p></div></div></div><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Reduce costs" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Reduce costs</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Reduce maintenance, cut expenses and streamline operations with a compact design, low life-cycle cost, simple ordering and combined 1A/5A CT inputs. Enjoy flexible use with full range power supply and binary inputs.</p></div></div></div><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Increase system availability" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Increase system availability</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Deliver higher system availability with IEC 61850 Editions 1 and 2, DNP3 TCP, Modbus TCP and HSR, PRP and RSTP support. Implement role-based access control for security. Select multiple languages for global deployment.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id='5hYqN8IvV4ev40UcOoIldi' class='sitesCardsContainer themed-component-wrapper' data-ste-section='cards-container_3' data-ste-section-id='5hYqN8IvV4ev40UcOoIldi'><is-land on:visible><div id="comp-5hYqN8IvV4ev40UcOoIldi" class="CardsContainer" data-component-type="CardsContainer"><section id="5hYqN8IvV4ev40UcOoIldi" class="cards-defaultBackground" role="region" aria-labelledby="section-heading-5hYqN8IvV4ev40UcOoIldi"><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Featured capabilities</span></h2></div></div></div></div><div class="container"><div class="row cards-container-row"><div class="siemens-cards col-md-4"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="card" data-ste-teaser-title="User-friendly interface" id="G_User-friendly%20interface-0" class="card blogWrapNoLink rounded-0" role="article" aria-labelledby="G_User-friendly%20interface-0-title" aria-describedby="G_User-friendly%20interface-0-desc" tabindex="0"><div class="imageWrapper"></div><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column p-3"><strong class="text-kicker pb-2 mb-0 text-color"></strong><div class="category d-none">all</div><h3 id="G_User-friendly%20interface-0-title" class="pb-4 mb-0">User-friendly interface</h3><div id="G_User-friendly%20interface-0-desc" class="text-black card-text pb-3 mb-0"><div><p>Use the large, backlit 128x128 LCD, tactile buttons and programmable LEDs for a user-friendly display of text, graphics and mimic diagrams.</p></div></div><div data-area="card-info-section" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-end h-100"></div></div></div></div><div class="siemens-cards col-md-4"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="card" data-ste-teaser-title="Comprehensive protection functions" id="G_Comprehensive%20protection%20functions-1" class="card blogWrapNoLink rounded-0" role="article" aria-labelledby="G_Comprehensive%20protection%20functions-1-title" aria-describedby="G_Comprehensive%20protection%20functions-1-desc" tabindex="0"><div class="imageWrapper"></div><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column p-3"><strong class="text-kicker pb-2 mb-0 text-color"></strong><div class="category d-none">all</div><h3 id="G_Comprehensive%20protection%20functions-1-title" class="pb-4 mb-0">Comprehensive protection functions</h3><div id="G_Comprehensive%20protection%20functions-1-desc" class="text-black card-text pb-3 mb-0"><div><p>Implement undercurrent, negative sequence, thermal overload, instantaneous and time-delayed overcurrent and earth fault protection. Safeguard your system with automatic reclosing and frequency protection.</p></div></div><div data-area="card-info-section" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-end h-100"></div></div></div></div><div class="siemens-cards col-md-4"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="card" data-ste-teaser-title="Modern connection and security features" id="G_Modern%20connection%20and%20security%20features-2" class="card blogWrapNoLink rounded-0" role="article" aria-labelledby="G_Modern%20connection%20and%20security%20features-2-title" aria-describedby="G_Modern%20connection%20and%20security%20features-2-desc" tabindex="0"><div class="imageWrapper"></div><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column p-3"><strong class="text-kicker pb-2 mb-0 text-color"></strong><div class="category d-none">all</div><h3 id="G_Modern%20connection%20and%20security%20features-2-title" class="pb-4 mb-0">Modern connection and security features</h3><div id="G_Modern%20connection%20and%20security%20features-2-desc" class="text-black card-text pb-3 mb-0"><div><p>Connect flexibly with IEC 61850 Ethernet, front USB, rear RS485 and RJ45 ports. Enhance cybersecurity with signed firmware, encrypted connections and role-based access control. Manage your device using the secure WebUI.</p></div></div><div data-area="card-info-section" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-end h-100"></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><template data-island><script type="module" src="/shared-assets/1f5459